    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d836">

                <pb facs="0918" n="632" xml:id="pg632"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 341.622a/31</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Nagasaki</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Baker</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nagasaki</hi></placeName>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic"><date
                                ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content"
                                calendar="gregorian" notAfter="1916-02-23T08:15:00-05:00"
                                notBefore="1916-02-18T00:00:00+09:00">undated</date></hi>.<lb/>[<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Received February 23, 1916, 8.15 a.
                        m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>British cruiser <hi rendition="#italic">Laurentic</hi> 18th instant, 10 miles
                    from entrance Yangtze River, fired blank and projectile shots; sent boat
                    containing heavily armed party 22. Two officers, 5 armed men boarded <hi
                        rendition="#italic">China</hi>, despite captain’s protest, removing 28
                    Germans, 8 Austrians, 2 Turks, including physicians and merchants.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Baker</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
